      "scene": "pull",
      "start": 2163,
      "end": 2403,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "Jojo pulls. And pulls. One more tug... Pop! A carrot! Leo lifts a pumpkin with both paws.",
